{"nodes":[{"id":"center","type":"text","text":"# Rouxls Kaard\n🃏 Card Kingdom Darkner; self-proclaimed \"Duke of Puzzles\" who serves the King in Ch.1.","x":-190,"y":-105,"width":420,"height":220,"color":"6"},{"id":"center-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rouxls_Kaard_face.png","x":-640,"y":-105,"width":181,"height":190},{"id":"s0","type":"text","text":"**Lancer**\nDespite the King's indifference, it's Rouxls who actually takes care of and feeds Lancer — his \"lesser father.\"","x":-130,"y":-640,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s1","type":"text","text":"**King**\nHis former lord in Ch.1, whom he serves with apparent loyalty as long as it suits him.","x":420,"y":-260,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2","type":"text","text":"**Queen**\nTries to become her right hand in Ch.2 — and in Ch.4 he's still chasing after her in a secret cutscene that ends with him turned into a lamp.","x":420,"y":220,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s2-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rouxls_Kaard_overworld_weather_hug.gif","x":420,"y":440,"width":202,"height":170},{"id":"s3","type":"text","text":"**Tenna**\nTries to be her second-in-command in Ch.3, forming a trio with Lanino and Elnina — Tenna, for her part, constantly mocks him in public, calling him a \"stupid lamp.\"","x":-130,"y":480,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s3-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rouxls_Kaard_screenshot_Cooking_Show.png","x":-130,"y":710,"width":200,"height":150},{"id":"s4","type":"text","text":"**Why does he always chase someone else's power?**\nA widespread reading (a very popular fandom headcanon, with no official confirmation) is that his constant need to be the \"right hand\" of whoever rules reflects a deeper crisis of purpose as a Darkner.","x":-680,"y":220,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"3"},{"id":"s5","type":"text","text":"**\"Rouxls Lampeth\"**\nThe secret Ch.4 cutscene where an electrical accident turns him into a lamp — unintentionally proving Tenna's Ch.3 taunt right.","x":-680,"y":-450,"width":280,"height":210,"color":"1"},{"id":"s5-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Rouxls_Kaard_overworld_petrified.png","x":-680,"y":-670,"width":144,"height":190},{"id":"s0-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/Lancer_Overworld.webp","x":-130,"y":-850,"width":148,"height":180},{"id":"s1-img","type":"file","file":"Sprites/King_face.png","x":420,"y":-470,"width":149,"height":180}],"edges":[{"id":"e0","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e1","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s1","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s2","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e2-img","fromNode":"s2","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s2-img","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"top","toNode":"s3","toSide":"bottom","color":"1"},{"id":"e3-img","fromNode":"s3","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s3-img","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"center","fromSide":"right","toNode":"s4","toSide":"left","color":"3"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"s0","fromSide":"left","toNode":"s5","toSide":"right","color":"1"},{"id":"e5-img","fromNode":"s5-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s5","toSide":"top","color":"6"},{"id":"e_s0-img","fromNode":"s0-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s0","toSide":"top","color":"1"},{"id":"e_s1-img","fromNode":"s1-img","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"s1","toSide":"top","color":"1"}]}